OL,3,GNEWSANew #20m robot lab to speed up
OL,4,Adisease research
OL,5,
OL,6,FResearchers in Liverpool say a new
OL,7,Frobotic laboratory could help speed up
OL,8,Fvaccine development and reduce the need
OL,9,Ffor animal testing.
OL,11,FThe #20m facility at the Liverpool
OL,12,FSchool of Tropical Medicine will use
OL,13,Flab-grown miniature human organs to
OL,14,Ftest treatments for infectious
OL,15,Fdiseases.
OL,17,FThe facility, which has been supported
OL,18,Fby the Infection Innovation Consortium
OL,19,F(iiCON), is due to be fully open by
OL,20,F2027.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
