OL,3,GNEWSANew #20m robot lab to speed up
OL,4,Adisease research
OL,5,
OL,6,FPro-vice chancellor for research and
OL,7,Finnovation, Prof Giancarlo Biagini,
OL,8,Fsaid: "It is really exciting to be
OL,9,Finvolved and it's going to accelerate
OL,10,Fthe way we develop drugs, vaccines and
OL,11,Fdiagnostics."
